1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:12,044
Memorise the words that make a statement negative without any not: never, hardly, scarcely, barely, seldom, rarely, few, little, no, none, nobody, nothing, neither, nowhere.

2
00:00:12,044 --> 00:00:13,697
They take a positive tag.

3
00:00:13,697 --> 00:00:17,031
But careful: a few and a little are positive.

4
00:00:17,031 --> 00:00:19,270
He has a little money, hasn't he?

